Ours.  1990s K&R declarations of the allocators ("char *malloc();", "Char *realloc(),
*calloc();") collide with <stdlib.h>, which every X compile now includes (amix-xlibc.h):
they become comments.  xinit's own static shutdown() is renamed xinit_shutdown(): the
name is the socket call amix-decls.h declares.

